This licence covers the contents of this repository only.

The explorer this project drives is Blockscout, which is distributed under its
own licence (LicenseRef-Blockscout) and is NOT covered by the MIT licence
above. Blockscout's source is not included in this repository — stack/setup.sh
fetches it from Blockscout and applies this project's overlay on your machine.

Two consequences of Blockscout's licence are worth knowing before you build on
this project:

  * Derivative works of Blockscout (which the patched frontend is) may be
    created for internal use, but may not be distributed to third parties
    without a commercial licence from Blockscout. That is why this project
    ships a Dockerfile that builds the explorer UI locally and never publishes
    the resulting image.
  * Modified Blockscout files must carry a notice saying they were modified and
    when. The files this project patches carry one; see
    stack/explorer-overlay/upstream.patch.

Read https://github.com/blockscout/frontend/blob/main/LICENSE before deploying
anything based on it.
